One of the [[Casterwill Hunters]] used this spell against [[Sophie Casterwill]] on the roof of [[the Cloisters]]. [[Lok Lambert]] was able to rescue her by pulling her out of the abyss. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}

Another Casterwill Hunter used the spell on [[Dante Vale]] outside the [[Pyramid of the Sun]], but he managed to overpower them. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}

[[Harrison Fears]] used the spell in his final battle against his brother [[Den Fears]] on a floating slab of rock. The spell forced the pair to jump to another rock. {{source|Lok and the Betrayer}}

